      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><span id=\"htZoomImageMsg\"></span></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThe game on this page helps you practice converting raised fingers into marks on a bone. Before starting, we suggest studying the following previous lessons:\n- **Our sides are equal**: you learn that your body has two similar sides (<htcite0>).\n- **Counting**: you learn how to count using your body (<htcite1>).\n- **Beyond fingers**: you see the limits of counting with your body and how marks on bones first appeared (<htcite2>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "20b14681-88c0-438a-a273-a0902ae5db38",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Our sides are equal",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2023",
                        "month": "05",
                        "day": "30"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "3874d1e8-0f76-4432-9ee2-d8c8c9dccf53",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Counting",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "06",
                        "day": "12"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "cc8c1467-a6af-4f9c-ba60-ab6df35aba05",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Beyond fingers",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "07",
                        "day": "23"
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
